      ":question/id": "1b810394-d279-5732-8d6a-b3fafda8fba7",
      ":question/problem": "Find $(A+B)-C-(B-C)$, if\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix},\\,B=\\begin{bmatrix}8 & 7 \\\\ 6 & 4\\end{bmatrix},\\,C=\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 5 \\\\ 9 & 3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$",
